EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}OK!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} So here are the game's rules.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}There are 3 cards here{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Each card has different pictures
on the back—{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}roses, cosmos, and
dandelions.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
I'll shuffle the cards, and then you'll
have to choose one.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}You have to
try to find the card with roses{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}After every round, you'll return the
card to the deck for me to shuffle
once again{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
We'll go through 3 rounds.
That's 3 and only 3.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}If you can draw the roses 3
times,{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} I'll just give you the
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} for free!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Keep in mind that the price will vary{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
depending on the number of correct
answers. So be careful, OK?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}That should be enough for the rules.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Shall we get started then?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}All right!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Please pick a card!{{TAG:0008:0001:0B0000000B0000000B000000}}
The one on the left.
The one in the middle.
The one on the right.

